hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1416","Ali bin Al-Hussein bin Ibrahim bin Abhar narrated to us, Muhammad bin Ubaid Al-Tanafisi narrated to us, Mas’ar bin Kadam narrated to us, on the authority of Yazid Al-Faqir, on the authority of Jabir bin Abdullah said: She came to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, crying, and he said: “O God, give us rain, relief, bitter, and horrific, sooner than later, and beneficial without Harmful,” so it applied to them"
"1417","Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Abu Hisham Al-Makhzoumi told us, on the authority of Wahib, on the authority of Yahya bin Saeed, on the authority of Anas bin Malik, that the Prophet prayed May God bless him and grant him peace. He said: “O God, give us water.”"
